### Projects

Featured projects include:

#### 1. Contact Form

A backend-based contact form application with API integration for sending submitted messages through Gmail.

**Technologies Used:**

* React
* Node.js
* Express.js
* MySQL

🔗 Live Demo: https://contact-form-two-brown.vercel.app/

---

#### 2. Digital Vault Security App

A web application designed to securely store user information and provide password-protected access.

**Technologies Used:**

* React
* MongoDB
* Node.js

🔗 Live Demo: https://digitalvault-securefamily-qdb3.vercel.app/

---

#### 3. Coffee Shop Website

A responsive single-page coffee shop website with Firebase integration.

**Technologies Used:**

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript
* Firebase

🔗 Live Demo: https://brew-haven-web.vercel.app/

---

#### 4. Stopwatch Web Application

A responsive stopwatch application featuring start, pause, reset, and lap tracking functionality.

**Technologies Used:**

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

🔗 Live Demo: https://keerthanagithub17.github.io/PRODIGY_WD_TASK2/

---

#### 5. Tic-Tac-Toe Game

An interactive two-player Tic-Tac-Toe game with game state management, player turns, and win detection.

**Technologies Used:**

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

🔗 Live Demo: https://keerthanagithub17.github.io/PRODIGY_WD_TASK3/

---

#### 6. Responsive Navigation Website

A responsive website featuring a fixed navigation menu with interactive scroll and hover effects.

**Technologies Used:**

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

🔗 Live Demo: https://keerthanagithub17.github.io/PRODIGY_WD_TASK1/

